      en: ["Main seaport of the Austro-Hungarian Empire", "Piazza Unità is Europe's largest sea-facing square", "Miramare Castle completed in 1860", "James Joyce lived in the city for over 10 years", "Founding city of the Generali insurance company", "Host of the world's largest sailing regatta"],
