      en: ["University established in the year 1222", "Home to Giotto's Scrovegni Chapel frescoes", "World's oldest botanical garden founded 1545", "Prato della Valle covers 90,000 square meters", "St. Anthony's Basilica is a major pilgrimage site", "Birthplace of the Roman historian Livy"],
